Dialogue: 10,0:01:38.24,0:01:39.45,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Get off!}¡Bájate! {AHR #06 [0:20:06.57]}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:53.17,0:01:55.05,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I accidentally fell in love...}Accidentalmente me enamoré...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:56.22,0:01:57.68,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{...with the same person...}de la misma persona...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:01.22,0:02:03.14,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{...as my best friend.}que mi mejor amiga.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:04.06,0:02:07.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You'll feel better after drinking some water.}Te sentirás mejor luego de tomar un poco de agua.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.52,0:02:08.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Thanks.}Gracias.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.06,0:02:12.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Wait, the money...}Espera, el dinero...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:12.90,0:02:14.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, don't worry about that.}Oh, no te preocupes por eso.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.03,0:02:17.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Thanks...}Gracias...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:24.04,0:02:28.04,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,La verdad, no es que me sienta mal...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.58,0:02:29.92,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,pero ya es tarde para decirlo.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:31.88,0:02:32.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.92,0:02:36.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Give me the water.}Dame {el agua}la botella.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:36.38,0:02:37.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Huh?!}¡¿Eh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.34,0:02:38.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't give me that.}{No me vengas con eso.}Nada de "¡¿Eh?!".{aj}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.09,0:02:41.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I bought it,}Yo la compré,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.10,0:02:44.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,puedo beber también.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.22,0:02:47.89,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Wait, isn't this an...}Espera, ¿no es eso un...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.23,0:02:48.85,AoHaru ital,,0,0,5,,{...in-}beso...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:50.10,0:02:50.98,AoHaru ital,,0,0,5,,{-direct...}indi-
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.31,0:02:53.23,AoHaru ital,,0,0,5,,{...k-ki...}rec...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.95,0:02:59.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What?}¿Qué?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.91,0:03:03.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{No, uh...}No, eh...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.12,0:03:06.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, are you a germaphobe or something?}Ah, ¿tienes fobia a los gérmenes o algo?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.12,0:03:10.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{No, that's not exactly it...}No, no es eso...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.96,0:03:13.46,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I didn't mean to stare like that.}No fue mi intención mirar así.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.46,0:03:15.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Fine, I got it.}Bien, entiendo.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.43,0:03:22.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{So cold! I'm chok—}¡Qué frío! Estoy tembl—
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.93,0:03:26.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Are you okay? Let me grab a towel...}¿Estás bien? Déjame darte una toalla...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.31,0:03:39.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sorry, looks like I kinda forgot it in the classroom.}Perdón, parece que la olvidé en el salón.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.69,0:03:41.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Just forget it.}Ni modo.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.99,0:03:43.24,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I can't believe it...}No puedo creerlo...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.24,0:03:48.24,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{The day where I finally feel embarrassed about my boorish facade has come.}Llegó el día en que me he avergonzado de mi aburrida forma de ser.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.50,0:03:55.79,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{But the reason everyone else dresses up and uses makeup}Pero la razón por la que todas se visten bien y usan maquillaje {AHR #02 [0:06:01.54]}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.79,0:03:58.00,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{is to look good for others, right?}es para que otros las noten, ¿verdad? {AHR #02 [0:06:05.95]}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.67,0:04:05.47,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{How is that different from me trying to look cute in front of the boys?}¿Qué diferencia hay entre eso y que yo actúe bonita frente a los chicos? {AHR #2 [0:06:08.82]}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.56,0:04:12.89,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Those words are really ringing true right now.}{\fs50}Esas palabras resuenan con mayor fuerza en este momento.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.89,0:04:14.73,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Really loudly...}Muy fuertemente...{}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.11,0:04:18.73,AoHaru ital,,0,0,15,,{Why am I acting all pure?!\an8}¡¿Por qué estoy actuando tan pura?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.73,0:04:21.28,AoHaru ital,,0,0,15,,{I messed up my bag and made it dirty on purpose!\an8}¡Desordené mi bolso y lo ensucié a propósito!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.28,0:04:22.45,AoHaru ital,,0,0,15,,{Disgusting! I'm disgusting!\an8}¡Asquerosa! ¡Doy asco!{cambié para ir acorde al cartelito, además eran muchos caracteres para tan poco tiempo, siempre más de 20 cps es realmente complicado leerlo todo}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.32,0:04:24.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What's wrong?}¿Qué pasa?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.24,0:04:26.87,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Still feeling sick?}¿Aún te sientes enferma?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.87,0:04:29.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{No, I'm totally better now.}No, ya estoy mucho mejor.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.54,0:04:33.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Really?}¿De veras?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.83,0:04:35.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Really...}De veras...{deveritas (???????}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.06,0:04:53.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Huh?}¿Ah?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.31,0:04:57.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You use perfume?}¿Estás... usando perfume?{¿Estás usando perfume?}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.40,0:05:01.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{No, not at all.}No, para nada.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.78,0:05:04.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh... must be your shampoo.}Ah... debe ser tu champú.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.37,0:05:11.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Well, what do you know. That turns me on.}Bueno, tú sabes... Eso me gusta.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.00,0:05:20.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Say something...}Di algo...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.34,0:05:28.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Come on, at least show some reaction.}Vamos, al menos alguna reacción.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.18,0:05:30.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Now I just look like a pervert.}Ahora me veo como un pervertido.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.68,0:05:36.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Y-You should make it easier for me to tell you're joking.}P-Pues, es que deberías ponérmelo más fácil si quieres que me dé cuenta que solo bromeas.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.52,0:05:41.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{How am I supposed to know what to say, silly...}¿Cómo se supone que sepa lo que debo decir? Tonto...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.53,0:05:46.49,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I just got the cheapest shampoo they had at the supermarket.}Solo compré el champú más \Nbarato que había en el mercado.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.03,0:05:52.03,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Whether he was joking or not, \NI should've gotten something better.}Aunque estuviera o no bromeando, \Ndebería haber comprado algo mejor.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.03,0:05:55.62,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{It's such a hassle being in love.}Enamorarse es una molestia.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.62,0:05:57.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, that reminds me.}Ah, eso me recuerda.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.42,0:05:58.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Of what?}¿Qué cosa?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.46,0:06:02.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I was supposed to pick up some \Nshampoo on the way home.}Se supone que debía comprar champú de regreso a casa.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.25,0:06:04.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Pues qué bien que lo recordaras.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.55,0:06:09.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I need to go swing by the drug store.}Tengo que pasar por la farmacia.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.80,0:06:13.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Are you really sure you're better now?}¿Estás segura que ya estás mejor?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.43,0:06:15.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't you worry!}¡No te peocupes!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.27,0:06:17.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Alright then. Later.}Está bien. Nos vemos.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.94,0:06:26.36,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I really do want to walk home with you, Kou,}En verdad me gustaría volver a casa junto contigo,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.40,0:06:30.99,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{but I wouldn't really feel right doing that.}pero no me sentiría bien haciendo eso.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.91,0:06:34.70,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Like I was betraying Yuuri.}Es como si estuviera traicionando a Yuuri.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.08,0:06:39.29,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Yuuri...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.21,0:06:42.63,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I have to tell her.}Tengo que decírselo.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.88,0:06:46.13,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I need to say I love Kou.}Decirle que me gusta Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.55,0:06:47.72,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I have to tell her.}Debo hacerlo.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.18,0:06:56.39,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{When you're in love, you become\N aware of the smallest details.}Cuando estás enamorada,\Nestás al tanto hasta de los detalles más ínfimos.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.39,0:07:01.52,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{It's supposed to be a real hassle,\N but the feelings that control you}Se supone que es una gran molestia,\N pero los sentimientos que te controlan...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.52,0:07:03.94,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{also uplift your spirits.}también elevan tu espíritu.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.94,0:07:05.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{Sorry for the delay.}Perdón por el retraso.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.44,0:07:07.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{Do you have a point card?}¿Tienes una tarjeta de puntos?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.78,0:07:08.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{Yes, right here.}Sí.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.86,0:07:10.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{Okay, I've scanned it in.}Bien. Ya está escaneado.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.07,0:07:11.32,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Isn't that...}Eso es...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.00,0:07:20.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{Payment of 3000 yen.}Son 3000 yenes.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.42,0:07:25.67,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I need to tell Yuuri soon.}Tengo que decirle a Yuuri rápido.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.17,0:07:28.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{Thank you very much.}Gracias por su preferencia.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.97,0:07:35.97,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{What will Yuuri think?}¿Qué irá a pensar Yuuri?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.56,0:07:39.18,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Will she start to hate me?}¿Comenzará a odiarme?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.18,0:07:41.19,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{No, Yuuri wouldn't...}No,{ Yuuri} no lo haría...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.19,0:07:42.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¿Futaba?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.19,0:07:51.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¿Yumi-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.82,0:07:57.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Odds and evens! One, two, shoot!}{No sé cómo ponerle.}{¡Uno, dos, dispara!}{Mega:}¡Piedra, papel o tijeras! ¡Piedra, papel o tijeras!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.54,0:08:01.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Naitou! What're you up to?}¡Naitou! ¿Qué están haciendo?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.74,0:08:00.54,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{Nice, I'm a cop.\an8}Bien, soy un policía.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.42,0:08:07.13,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Yumi-chan was my classmate in middle school.}Yumi-chan era mi compañera en secundaria.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.13,0:08:10.67,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{We were very close friends.}Éramos amigas muy cercanas.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.13,0:08:14.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Splitting teams for cops and robbers.}Dividiendo equipos en{de} policías y ladrones.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.14,0:08:16.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, let's play.}Oigan, juguemos.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.43,0:08:23.98,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Yumi-chan had a crush on a boy named Naitou-kun,}Yumi-chan se enamoró de un chico llamado Naitou-kun,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.73,0:08:25.35,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{I haven't played this since I was a kid!\an8}¡No he jugado esto desde que era una niña!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.69,0:08:26.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Same here.}Igual yo.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.65,0:08:28.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's like we're back in elementary school!}¡Parece que estuviéramos en primaria!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.57,0:08:29.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Isn't it?}¿Verdad?{'Eda?}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.65,0:08:32.15,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Kou was standing behind them.}Kou estaba detrás de ellos.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.07,0:08:31.53,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{Let me play too!\an8}¡Déjenme jugar también!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.53,0:08:34.07,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{What, you serious?\an8}¿Qué? ¿En serio?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.07,0:08:35.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Let's all play together!}¡Juguemos todos juntos!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.74,0:08:39.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Really? Cops and robbers?}¿De veras? ¿Policías y ladrones?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.62,0:08:41.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What, the girls are in too?}¿Qué? ¿Las chicas también?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.75,0:08:44.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{How about it, Futaba?}¿Qué hay de ti, Futaba?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.30,0:08:56.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I guess... I'll play.}Supongo que... jugaré.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.39,0:08:58.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Then that's that!}¡Entonces, hagámoslo!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.60,0:09:00.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{I'm counting to one hundred!}¡Contaré hasta cien!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.72,0:09:05.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{One! Two! Three!}¡Uno! ¡Dos! ¡Tres!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.02,0:09:06.19,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Everything was peaceful throughout my first year in middle school.}Todo estuvo tranquilo durante mi primer año de secundaria.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.53,0:09:15.07,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{But when the next year rolled around...}Pero cuando el siguiente año comenzó...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.07,0:09:17.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, isn't Yoshioka kinda cute?}Oye, ¿no te parece linda Yoshioka?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.49,0:09:19.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, she totally is.}Sí, realmente lo es.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.70,0:09:21.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{She's so refined.}Es tan refinada.{}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.29,0:09:24.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{The other girls could learn a thing or two from her.}Las otras chicas podrían aprender un par de cosas de ella.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.04,0:09:31.63,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I started drawing attention, for better or worse.}Comencé a llamar la atención, para bien o para mal.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.13,0:09:35.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Futaba's just putting on an act for the guys.}Futaba solo está actuando para los chicos.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.38,0:09:37.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Right? She pisses me off.}¿Verdad? Me hace hervir.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.51,0:09:39.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.14,0:09:41.35,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{But even then...}Pero incluso entonces...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.35,0:09:46.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{They're just jealous that the boys are all over you.}Solo están celosas porque todos los chicos te miran ti.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.98,0:09:49.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You know it's not your fault.}Sabes que no es tu culpa.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.52,0:09:50.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Idiots, all of them.}Son unas idiotas.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.69,0:09:56.28,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{She was the only one who stuck by my side.}Ella fue la única que permaneció a mi lado.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.28,0:09:58.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll always be there for you.}Siempre estaré ahí para ti.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.78,0:10:02.08,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{But one day...\fad(0,2500)}Pero un día...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.08,0:10:05.70,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{...Yumi-chan suddenly stopped talking to me.}...Yumi-chan de repente dejó de hablarme.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.70,0:10:07.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Wait up, I'll go too!}¡Esperen, yo también iré!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.92,0:10:11.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yumi, are you sure you wanna leave Futaba behind?}Yumi, ¿estás segura de quieres dejar a Futaba sola?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.17,0:10:13.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Um... yeah, don't worry about it.}Ah... sí, no te preocupes por eso.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.55,0:10:20.89,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{My last remaining ally left my side\N without ever telling me why.}Mi última amiga{aliada}{ah} dejó de estar a mi lado sin siquiera decirme por qué.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.64,0:10:27.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I don't think I've seen you since graduation.}Creo que no te he visto desde la graduación.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.23,0:10:29.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah...}Sí...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.94,0:10:36.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Remember Naitou?}¿Recuerdas a Naitou?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.61,0:10:40.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{The guy you had a crush on?}¿El chico del que te enamoraste?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.58,0:10:49.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Man, I remember asking you for advice about him all the time.}Recuerdo que te pedía consejos todo el tiempo.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.33,0:10:53.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah...}Sí...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.63,0:10:55.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Good times...}Qué buenos tiempos...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.80,0:10:59.68,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{What a lie. I'd erase that from my memory if I could.}Mentira. Los borraría de mi memoria si pudiera.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.38,0:11:03.51,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I just don't know what else to say}Es solo que no sé qué más decirle...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.51,0:11:08.02,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{to someone who deserted me without any explanation.}a alguien que me abandonó sin ninguna explicación.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.02,0:11:09.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, actually...}Oye, en realidad...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.10,0:11:14.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I've always wanted to apologize to you.}siempre quise disculparme contigo.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.57,0:11:18.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Tú sabes, cierto día,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.49,0:11:23.87,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{a girl told me that you also liked Naitou-kun.}una chica me dijo que a ti \Ntambién te gustaba Naitou-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.91,0:11:30.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{When I went to ask you about it...}Cuando fui a preguntártelo...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.37,0:11:33.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¡Futaba!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.34,0:11:40.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I saw your eyes on him.}{Vi tus ojos sobre él.}Noté cómo lo mirabas.{Vi que le tenías clavada la vista. (((????????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.68,0:11:47.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I thought, "I'm the one who loved him first!"}Pensé, "¡A mí me gustó primero!".
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.68,0:11:53.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I know that liking someone first doesn't actually mean anything.}Yo sé que no significa nada que alguien te guste primero.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.52,0:11:58.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{But by then, I'd lost my reasoning}Pero para entonces, ya había perdido mi razonamiento
Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.57,0:12:01.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{and was boiling with rage at you.}y estaba hirviendo de ira contra ti.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.99,0:12:12.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I knew that if I left, you'd be all alone. Sorry—}Sabía que si me iba, te quedarías sola. Lo siento—
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.54,0:12:14.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yumi-chan, yo...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.63,0:12:19.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I never felt that way about Naitou-kun.}Yo nunca sentí nada por Naitou-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.63,0:12:25.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Looking back, there was even another boy I liked.}En ese entonces, había otro chico que me gustaba.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.18,0:12:32.14,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I knew that Naitou-kun was friends with Kou, so I wanted to ask if he'd heard anything,}Sabía que Naitou-kun era amigo de Kou,\Nasí que quise preguntarle si había escuchado algo,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.14,0:12:36.31,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{or if he knew anything about how Kou was.}o si sabía un poco sobre cómo era Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.02,0:12:43.15,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Yumi-chan got the wrong idea.}Yumi-chan lo malinterpretó.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.90,0:12:44.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.12,0:12:47.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sorry.}Lo siento.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.41,0:12:52.87,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{When you fall in love with the person your friend likes,}Cuando te enamoras de la \Npersona que le gusta a tu amiga,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.50,0:12:58.13,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{this is what happens.}esto{eso} es lo que sucede.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.46,0:13:05.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sorry, I've gotta go.}Lo siento, tengo que irme.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.18,0:13:09.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Me ha alegrado volverte a ver.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.27,0:13:18.61,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I was naive.}Fui ingenua.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.32,0:13:28.49,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I was hoping that Yuuri might not get mad at me when I told her...}Esperaba que Yuuri no se enojara conmigo cuando se lo contara...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.79,0:13:36.92,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{But just like Yumi-chan, she'll probably end up falling prey to her feelings}Pero al igual que Yumi-chan, probablemente termine cayendo presa de sus sentimientos
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.50,0:13:39.71,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{and be overcome with hate.}y sea superada por el odio.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.50,0:13:45.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Why did she have to show up now of all times?}¿Por qué de todos los momentos tuvo que aparecer ahora?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.01,0:13:49.47,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{It feels like God is testing me.}Siento como si Dios me pusiera a prueba.{avance #06}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.43,0:13:55.14,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{But... I can't lie about my feelings for Kou anymore.}Pero... no puedo seguir mintiendo sobre mis sentimientos por Kou.{Cambiar avance #06 en batch o BD}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.10,0:14:00.44,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I really have no choice but to tell her!}¡Pero es que no tengo más opción que decírselo!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.19,0:14:03.28,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I have to...}Tengo que hacerlo...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.03,0:14:11.74,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{How many days has it been since I said that?}¿Cuántos días han pasado desde que dije eso?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.74,0:14:13.95,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Just talk to her already, dammit!}¡Solo habla con ella de una vez, maldición!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.95,0:14:16.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Useless! Useless! Useless!}¡Inútil! ¡Inútil! ¡Inútil!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.33,0:14:17.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Good morning.}Buenos días.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.08,0:14:19.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Futaba-chan, good morning.}Futaba-chan, buenos días.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.88,0:14:21.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Morning...}Buenos días...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.22,0:14:29.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Makita.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.09,0:14:32.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I brought the CD you texted me about yesterday.}Te traje el CD que me pediste ayer por mensaje.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.02,0:14:35.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Thank you!}¡Gracias!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.14,0:14:40.65,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{They text each other?}¿Se envían mensajes?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.65,0:14:43.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{There's a secret cover he did of his own song on it.}{esto es muy random}{K}{Hay un demo secreto que no fue publicado.}{sho:}{http://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Versi%C3%B3n_%28m%C3%BAsica%29}{(?)}Trae una versión secreta que hizo de su propia canción.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.27,0:14:44.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, yeah!}¡Sí, sí!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.27,0:14:45.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You gotta listen to it.}Tienes que escucharla.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.45,0:14:50.49,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Yuuri's so lucky.}Qué suerte tiene Yuuri.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.45,0:14:51.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{What song's your favorite?}¿Cuál es tu canción favorita?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.03,0:14:55.37,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{It's all so easy when you've got that cute personality established.}Es tan fácil cuando tienes una linda personalidad.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.78,0:14:55.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{If I had to pick, it'd be this one.}Si tuviera que elegir, sería esta.{ésta}{?}{'ésta' <-NO}{ah}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.75,0:14:59.83,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{What was that? My jealousy's taking over!}¿Qué fue eso? ¡Los celos me superan!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.83,0:15:02.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{This is the one used in that commercial.}Esta es la que usan en ese comercial.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.71,0:15:05.75,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{But...}Pero...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.67,0:15:13.47,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I also understand why Yuuri wants people to think she's cute.}También entiendo por qué Yuuri quiere que la gente piense que es linda.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.47,0:15:16.06,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{What is this emotion?}¿Qué es esta emoción?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.06,0:15:17.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.06,0:15:20.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Mabuchi-kun lent me a CD!}¡Mabuchi-kun me prestó un CD!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.02,0:15:22.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{That's great...}Qué bien...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.57,0:15:26.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Murao-san, good morning.}Murao-san, buenos días.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.11,0:15:27.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Morning.}Buenos días.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.90,0:15:28.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey.}Hola.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.28,0:15:34.87,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Yuuri is just}Yuuri solo...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.87,0:15:38.54,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{doing everything she can.}está haciendo todo lo que puede.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.54,0:15:42.33,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{She's nothing like me, holding everything in.}No es como yo, que me quedo callada.{}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.71,0:15:44.21,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I'm the worst.}Soy de lo peor.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:50.72,0:15:51.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.89,0:15:56.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What?! What is it?}¡¿Qué?! ¿Qué ocurre?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.31,0:15:58.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You don't know?}¿Qué te pasa?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.48,0:16:00.77,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Tell me!}¡Dime!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.02,0:16:09.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{Your part of the report had way too many things wrong with it.}Tu parte del informe del campamento de \Nliderazgo tenía muchas faltas de ortografía.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.69,0:16:12.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{They said we had to redo it and hand it in again.}Dijeron que teníamos que hacerlo de nuevo.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.49,0:16:17.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You got it...}Entendido...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.41,0:16:21.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You feeling alright?}¿Te sientes bien?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.67,0:16:35.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll tell her! I swear I'll tell her...}¡Se lo diré! Juro que lo haré...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.80,0:16:36.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll say it!}¡Voy a decirle!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.68,0:16:41.98,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I can't say it...}No puedo decirle...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.98,0:16:45.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Futaba-chan, not feeling hungry? Are you sick?}Futaba-chan, ¿no tienes hambre? ¿Estás enferma?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.98,0:16:48.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I bought too much out of habit.}Compré más de lo normal.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.36,0:16:51.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yuuri, want a chocolate roll?}Yuuri, ¿quieres un pan de chocolate?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.65,0:16:56.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What about anpan? Or a yakisoba roll?}¿Qué tal un anpan? ¿O un sándwich de yakisoba?{}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.28,0:16:59.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I-I couldn't eat that much.}N-No creo que pueda comer tanto.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.37,0:17:02.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, right.}Uh, cierto.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.58,0:17:05.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Murao-san, want any?}Murao-san, ¿quieres alguno?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.83,0:17:07.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Not really.}No realmente.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.58,0:17:09.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Figures.}Lo supuse.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.34,0:17:11.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Maybe I should return them.}Tal vez deba devolverlos.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.30,0:17:13.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I don't think they let you return bread.}No creo que te dejen devolver el pan.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.38,0:17:16.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll go and check anyway.}Pero iré a intentarlo igual.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.01,0:17:18.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¡Futaba-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.93,0:17:19.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah?}¿Sí?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.56,0:17:21.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Want me to come with you?}¿Quieres que vaya contigo?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.10,0:17:23.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll be fine by myself.}No. Estaré bien sola.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:29.23,0:17:30.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Did I...}¿Será que...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.11,0:17:35.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{...do something bad to Futaba-chan?}le hice algo malo a Futaba-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:38.20,0:17:40.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm going to go after her.}Iré tras ella.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.46,0:17:52.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{Excuse me, so you know the girl who always buys a lot...}Disculpe, ¿no vio a una chica que siempre compra mucho...?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.54,0:17:53.76,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I want to stay friends with Yuuri.}Quiero seguir siendo amiga de Yuuri.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.51,0:17:58.59,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I also want to stay in love with Kou.}También quiero seguir enamorada de Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.09,0:18:04.56,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Guess it's impossible to eat my cake and have it too.}Supongo que no puedo tener ambas cosas.{}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.06,0:18:09.27,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Kou probably doesn't even see me as a girl anyway.}Kou ni siquiera me ve como a una chica de todos modos.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.27,0:18:12.40,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{In that case I can keep it a secret from Yuuri}Siendo así, podré guardarle el secreto a Yuuri
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.40,0:18:15.86,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{and just watch him from afar.}y simplemente observarlo desde lejos.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.86,0:18:21.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Kou, what are you doing?! \NI almost had a heart—}Kou, ¿qué estás haciendo?\N Casi haces que me dé un infar—
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.87,0:18:25.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Silencio.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.62,0:18:27.33,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Close! Close! Close! Close!}¡Cerca! ¡Cerca! ¡Cerca! ¡Muy cerca!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.55,0:18:34.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¡Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.84,0:18:36.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Crap, he's here.}Mierda, ahí viene.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.26,0:18:38.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¿Tanaka-sensei?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.05,0:18:39.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Where'd you go?}¿Dónde estás?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.84,0:18:41.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¡Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.02,0:18:48.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Why are you hiding from him?}¿Por qué te escondes de él?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:50.31,0:18:54.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{He's so stubborn about having dinner together.}Sigue con eso de que cenemos juntos.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.11,0:18:58.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Why not just do it?}¿Y por qué no lo haces?{*haces | hacen implicaría que ambos tienen que hacerlo, pero el profesor sí quiere, solo es cuestión de Kou}{aj}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.24,0:19:09.87,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{His silence is telling me not to pry any further.}Su silencio dice que no debo seguir preguntando.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.29,0:19:15.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Did you change your shampoo?}¿Cambiaste de champú?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.34,0:19:22.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I wanted to turn you on.}Quería que te gustara.{<3}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.27,0:19:32.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, you were right.}Ah, tenías razón.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.48,0:19:37.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It does get awkward when you can't tell if it's a joke.}Es incómodo cuando no sabes si es una broma o no.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:39.49,0:19:43.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Right, well my brother's gone, so I'll be off.}Bien, ya se fue mi hermano, así que me voy.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.99,0:19:47.74,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Watch from afar?}¿Mirar desde lejos?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.74,0:19:51.33,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I try my hardest to make something happen given the slightest chance.}Intento con todas mis fuerzas que\N algo suceda por más mínimo que sea.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.92,0:19:55.84,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I even changed my shampoo for him.}Incluso cambié de champú por él.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.84,0:19:59.26,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I'm doing all sorts of sneaky things behind Yuuri's back.}Estoy haciendo todo tipo de cosas a espaldas de Yuuri.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.68,0:20:03.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, right.}Ah, cierto.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.26,0:20:05.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Makita was looking for you.}Makita te está buscando.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.97,0:20:10.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{She seemed really worried. \NDid something happen?}Parecía preocupada. ¿Sucedió algo?{sorry, aunque no del todo mal, se me hacen muy cortas las dos expresiones como para romper la línea en dos}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.85,0:20:17.40,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Yuuri was worried about me?}¿Yuuri está... preocupada por mí?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.90,0:20:21.36,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{You see?}¿Lo ves?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.32,0:20:25.07,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{That's the kind of girl she is.}Esa es la clase de chica que es.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.78,0:20:29.87,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I knew Yuuri was a good girl.}Sabía que Yuuri era una buena chica.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.20,0:20:37.25,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{She's an incredibly dear friend of mine.}Es una amiga muy preciada para mí.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.25,0:20:40.30,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{When you talked to me that day,}Cuando me hablaste ese día, {AHR #05 [0:14:18.45]}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.30,0:20:43.13,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{can you imagine just how happy I was?}¿sabes cuán feliz me hiciste? {AHR #05 [0:14:21.48]}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.05,0:20:48.64,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{That's why I'll never leave you alone.}Por eso... nunca te dejaré sola. {AHR #05 [0:14:29.45]}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:48.64,0:20:50.22,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I promise.}Lo prometo. {AHR #05[0:14:29.45]}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.73,0:20:57.31,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{That's why I want us to stay friends.}Por eso quiero que sigamos siendo amigas.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:01.15,0:21:06.70,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{But because she's so dear to me, I have to tell her.}Pero porque es una amiga muy preciada para mí, debo decirle.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.37,0:21:09.37,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Whatever happens after that..}Lo que pase después...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:10.62,0:21:12.33,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{...is up to Yuuri.}depende de Yuuri.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:27.68,0:21:28.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¡Futaba-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:30.14,0:21:34.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{The donut shop in front of the station is having a 100-yen sale.}La tienda de donas frente a la estación tiene nuevas ofertas.{~}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.56,0:21:37.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Wanna stop by with me?}¿Quieres que vayamos juntas?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:38.77,0:21:39.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yuuri...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:44.40,0:21:45.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sure.}Sí.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.11,0:21:49.70,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Today, I might lose...}Hoy podría perder...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:52.20,0:21:54.04,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{...a very dear friend.}a una amiga muy preciada.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:26.84,0:23:29.34,AoHaru,,0,500,0,,{Even if one of you succeeds,}Aun si una de ustedes tiene éxito,
Dialogue: 10,0:23:29.34,0:23:33.09,AoHaru,,0,500,0,,{I'll still be on both of your sides.}seguiré estando al lado de ambas.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:34.22,0:23:36.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Good luck, you two.}Buena suerte a las dos.
